      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This post does not have a lot of info to go off of to \"fix perf issues in VRChat.\"\n\nSomething constructive I can suggest is that many people have issues or perf issues with the native Meta Quest link.\n\nHave you tried Steam Link? It's available in the App store on your Quest 3. This will cut out the Meta software. You might look into trying out Virtual Desktop too. But that is a paid app.\n\nDo you happen to know what your render resolution is set to?\n\nDo you have single digit FPS in every world/instance you join?\n\nYou should also go through this document and experiment with the things it suggests:\n\nhttps://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/10292084930323-I-m-experiencing-performance-issues-heavy-frame-drops",
